          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "On 2026-06-23, Provincial Public Health Institute issued warnings for Verlow and deployed assistance; on 2026-06-25, service at Verlow General Hospital was disrupted and Marnest substation was destroyed; on 2026-06-26, injuries were confirmed in Verlow; on 2026-06-27, people moved away from Verlow due to displacement; on 2026-06-28, Provincial Public Health Institute issued warnings and confirmed heatwave caused deaths; on 2026-07-01, dangerous conditions were present at Hetton Rise and Camber Green, and a meeting was held in Verlow.",
